msgstr "Un simbolo si disegna solo in pianta: cambiano solo i suoi livelli di dettaglio"

#: crates/ui-egui/src/titleblocks.rs:146
msgid "A text names a field as {KEY}. A project field has one value for every sheet; a sheet field, each sheet's own, filled in under Properties. The automatic fields need no definition:"
